T: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"80\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">대학추천</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"80\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">소속대학 총장 명의 추천서</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">(반드시 총장 명의 공문으로 추천)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">WEST 프로그램에 대해</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\"> 학점 인정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">하는</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\"> 대학에 한하여 추천권 부여</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 22.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(『학점인정』학칙 개정 예정인 대학 포함)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt\">3. <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">참가신청 기간 및 방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">○</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">접수 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">’11.12. 26(월) 09:00 ~ ’12. 1. 19(목) 18:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;○</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt\">참가신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt\">(온라인 접수) : 교육과학기술부 정부해외인턴사업 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt\">홈페이지(www.ggi.go.kr)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">를 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">통해 참가신청서 등을 작성․제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">하고 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">구비서류는 해당 대학에 직접 제</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">하여야 합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt\">구비서류, 스폰서정보 및 선발일정 등 자세한 사항은 WEST 카페(cafe.naver.com/westwhp) 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">4. <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">WEST 프로그램 설명회 : ‘11. 12. 20(화) 15:00～, 이화여자대학교 ECC동</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
